      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-12-25T21:20:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, we did the usual thing of getting up and opening the prezzies first. Then we did not-very-much while Dad cooked the dinner, then after dinner we played some games. A friend brought round a card game called Cards Against Humanity which I'd heard of but had no idea what it was about - I'm guessing that there are at least a few people here who have probably played it, this being a gaming forum and all. I wonder how wrong it would be to say that it was really fun and we all had a great laugh playing it and want to play it again :D Anyway, mid-game we took a break of an hour to watch Doctor Who, then got back and finished the game, had our Christmas tea of nommy sandwich thingys and cakes and biscuits and that kind of thing. And now I'm on my computer sorting out my forums as I haven't been online all day ;).</p>",
